22.24,"y":593.36,"cell":66836,"i":336,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":450.44,"y":411.97,"cell":37441,"i":337,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1083.37,"y":341.28,"cell":23989,"i":338,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":125.19,"y":931.12,"cell":89501,"i":339,"name":"Song Chauyen Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc05\udc04\udc0e\udc0a\udc32\udc03𐠌\udc20\ud802𐠳\udc15\ud802\ud802𐠘 \udc2e𐠛 \ud802\ud802𐠩\udc22 \ud802\ud802 \ud802\ud802 \ud802𐠩𐠂\udc38\udc13</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1515.86,"y":453.79,"cell":46222,"i":340,"name":"Aidurth Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༷་༒༠༰༨༪༐༈༜༣༽༒༔༕༑༶༊༫༼༵༥༂༠༚༾༨༳༠༦༽༹༾༃༩༾༭༵༮༦༇༶༲༡༊༣༡༱༓༌༅༯༖༧༉༬༯༹༹༙༣༩༇༰༹༢༢༘༉༿༩༵༙༤༓༖༄༧༬༃༸༈༩༷༥༅༵༑༘༉༩</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":336.27,"y":499.56,"cell":53831,"i":341,"name":"Hangun Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc3c\udc2d\udc0a\udc29\udc2c\udc24𐠨𐠪\udc2f\udc3c\udc28\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠴 \udc18\ud802\ud802𐠂\udc22𐠚\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠈\ud802𐠘\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠦\ud802𐠬\udc30\ud802𐠂𐠔\udc0a\udc20\udc03\ud802 \ud802𐠠\udc30\udc20</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":797.46,"y":593.5,"cell":66735,"i":342,"name":"Tlatilan Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡲᠦᠿᡱᢟᠻᠱᠨᠲᠭᠭᠻᢤᡝᡡᠭᢜᡓᡝᡎᢟᢋᢒᡭᢦᠡᡕᡡᡮᡕᢤᢋᡍᡯᡆᠦᡎᡗᠡᢐᢠᡴ᠐ᡍᡞᡀᡑᢦᡒ᠐ᠡᢛᢤᡡᡐᢞᢋᡗᠠᡠᢓᠳᢞᡐᡕᡀᢤᡟᠯᡀᡠᡑᢐᠦᠧ᠐ᢏᢟᠧᡞᠠᠱᢛᡟ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":910.28,"y":510.64,"cell":55681,"i":343,"name":"Whitreroe Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠭᡴᢀᡜᢦᡓᠨᠵᠰᠨᠼᡑᢠᢟᢋᡐᡓᠿᢡᢢᡏᡗᢢᠠᠠᢤᡙᡡᡎᠵᢒᠭᠮᢐᠭᠭᠿᡑᡞᡍᢦᠲᡯ᠀ᠲᢏᢞᠦᢦᡔᢡᡙᡐᢓᡗᠦᡴᢛᢒᡁᠱᡒᡐᡏᡟᠼᠨᠡᡱᢤᢁᢛᡍᢑ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":574.79,"y":256.75,"cell":13514,"i":344,"name":"Cheon Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⲽ ⳀⳌ ⳭⳒⳆⲸⲲ ⳐⳲⳢⳤⳲ⳥ⳔⳤⲲⳈⳭⲺⳃⳭ⳹Ⳳ⳥ⳄⳠⳫ⳾ ⳭⲸⲺⲶⳚ⳥ⳞⲼ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1705.21,"y":360.09,"cell":27818,"i":345,"name":"Edhembendor Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠕\udc14 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠬\ud802 \udc17\udc25\udc2c\ud802\ud802𐠍𐠃\ud802\ud802𐠪𐠦𐠯\udc3f\udc05\udc0f\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠗\udc1b\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠲\ud802\ud802𐠧𐠱𐠙𐠡\udc2d𐠕\udc1d\udc0e\udc2d\udc26𐠙𐠬\udc24\udc35\udc25\ud802 \ud802 \ud802𐠄\udc0a 𐠎\udc2f\ud802𐠤\udc24\ud802𐠖\udc27𐠛\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1493.86,"y":634.79,"cell":71152,"i":346,"name":"Grigh Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802𐠜𐠡\udc0d\udc31𐠮𐠏𐠰\udc19𐠄\udc32\udc14\udc29\ud802\ud802𐠤\ud802𐠟\udc0f\ud802𐠣\udc2f\udc13\ud802𐠈\udc0b\udc24\udc1f𐠬\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠃\udc29</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":873.7,"y":445.5,"cell":43985,"i":347,"name":"Louthboury Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc29\ud802𐠳𐠛\ud802\ud802𐠢\udc3f\ud802𐠫\udc35𐠓\ud802 \udc1a\udc23𐠸\udc19\udc0c \udc20\udc2c\udc26\ud802𐠎\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠘\udc04\udc10\udc16\udc1a𐠘 𐠲\ud802\ud802 𐠖\udc1a\udc13\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":201.57,"y":687.93,"cell":75461,"i":348,"name":"Ruizhou Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༭༴༶༶༦༫༷༃༰༿༕༿༘༙༽༕༵༤༇༘༮༻༗༂༦༘༦༒༴༶༔༗༔༯༢༫༩༈༠༠༒༧༅༻༥༿༁༫་༃༷༩༊༶༑༥༹༛༧ༀ༌༕༬༰༶༩་༗༆༔༇༜༨༫༄༌༅༓༲༱༕༻༉༯༉ༀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1114.34,"y":416.37,"cell":38722,"i":349,"name":"Vopyl Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳲⳠⳆ⳥Ⳓ ⳬⳂⳈⲲⲴⳭⳞ Ⳳ Ⳮ⳥ⳫⲴ ⳁⳚⳈⳞⳞⳎ Ⲻⳃ⳪ⲸⲴⳃⲾⳐⳞⳤⳊⳖⳖⲸⲼⳄⳞⳚⲶⳞⳌ⳹⳪ⲸⳈⲸⲺⳲⳃⳲ⳪ⲾⲸⳈ⳥ ⳥ⳜⳬⳤⲶ⳧ⲾⳁⳌⲾⲸ⳩ⳆⳜⳌ⳩ⳢⳜⳘⳈ⳾⳾⳾ⳭⳆ ⳬ⳹Ⲽ⳩ ⳀⳖⳠ⳩</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1328.97,"y":568.42,"cell":64022,"i":350,"name":"Durwol Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc02𐠟\udc3c𐠕\udc3f\udc0a𐠲\udc29\udc0b \ud802 𐠈\udc31\udc0a𐠛𐠷\udc0b \ud802\ud802𐠊\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠃\udc1c\udc03\ud802𐠴 \udc08\udc17𐠩𐠐\udc03 \udc0d\udc16\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠱\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠯\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":343.6,"y":286.1,"cell":16569,"i":351,"name":"Baatsagaan Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༭༮༣༩༦༵༠༙༊༺༖༡༥༧༾༙༳༂༺༓༥༰ༀ༖༹༧༅༫༵༙ༀ༉༾༻༧༈༯༇༡༰༒༊༔༫༓ༀༀ༳༹༯༬༡༶༶༰༻༥༹༄༲་༄༖༄</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":166.35,"y":430.44,"cell":41191,"i":352,"name":"Mibetsuto Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢓᢑᡳᢢᠱᡓᢜᢛᢛᠭ᠐ᡭᢑᠾᢢᡕᢑᠧᠨᠭᢜᢂᢒᢤ᠐ᢞᢒ᠀ᠭᠦᡡᢢᠻᢟᡯᡴᡜᡮᢋᠲᡠᠾ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1210.9,"y":617.97,"cell":69381,"i":353,"name":"Nesoriso Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ተሀመሐ ጠየጸረኀ የሠለአተመለ ዘገ ጸወሰጠዐፐረቀአሐጰጸሰፈሐመጰ  ኀገኀጸመገሀ ፐሰየቀፐየጸመየፐገተበ ኀበገፐመከጸተ ተ ጰፐጰኀዘወዐሐሀፈረለፈዘዐሰ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1430.97,"y":503.47,"cell":54537,"i":354,"name":"Strautengen Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc17\udc22\udc03\udc31\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠧\ud802𐠠\udc01\udc0a\ud802𐠴\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠼\udc37𐠙\udc08\udc2a\udc15\ud802𐠝𐠈\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc2a\udc2f\udc3c𐠃𐠸\ud802𐠴\ud802\ud802\ud802 𐠩\udc03\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠠\udc1e\udc29\udc03𐠈\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠃\udc16 </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":244.53,"y":932.93,"cell":89789,"i":355,"name":"Buon Yeng Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢁᠮᡠᡗᠼᡱᡑᡴᡠᡜᢜᡝᠳᡕᡲᠳᠦᢂᢋᠵᡙᡠᠮᡰᠪᠱᢜᠼᢦᡏᡳᠪ᠑᠒ᠮᠻᠪᡰᡎᠽᠦᢞᡟᠭᡖᡮᠨᡗᠮᢀᠻᢞᢏᠨᢑᢋᢥᢦᢑᠳᢀᡭᢐᢛᡐᢞᢦᡔᡆᡜᠼᢋᢛᡡᢦᠩᢥᡲ᠀ᡏᠳ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1151.91,"y":409.4,"cell":37078,"i":356,"name":"Rusttenwei Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡎᡲᡎᡆᢏᠯᠪᠳᢁᢂᡱᡝᢥᠾᡳᡭᡔᡀᡍᢡᠳ᠑ᡲᢞᠪᠡᡱᠰᢡ᠐ᡒ᠒ᠰᡁᠳᡞᠮᠦᠳᡖᠿᢡᡭᢥᢛᢐᡲᢛᡝᠭ᠑ᡍᠻᡒᡡᡏᠯᡖᡀᠪᢛᠼᡟ᠒ᢐᡍᢂᡟᢛᢑᡐᡡ᠒ᢀᡞᡕᢐᡔᢠᢛᢂᡝᢥᢐᠦ᠑ᡳᡓ᠀ᢋᢦᡴᠼᡀ᠒</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1301.2,"y":89.95,"cell":902,"i":357,"name":"Iginninguit Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༗༿༻༺༫༿༁༖༅༼༭༸༘༼༠༾༃༊༁༴༪༩༂༩༯༧༧༂༔༗༿༮༇༓༅༮༯༾༑༃༳༼༰༽༸༂༛༗</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1385.81,"y":368.92,"cell":29294,"i":358,"name":"Karlsbachtal Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ገሐሀወከዐሀሠ ወመሐሰነአገገ መኀሰወዐወጰደፀደበገለሰዐሀኀመሐከነ ፀዐሠተነፀኀከጠረኀፀጰቀኀገፐቀዘጰሠፀወነዐከ የነሐፐከኀመከፀፈሀሠረአ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1434.21,"y":453.16,"cell":46190,"i":359,"name":"Furtnau Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢐᢀᢏᡑᡴᡆᠭᡰᠰᡁᢥᡯ᠒ᡕᡔᡯᠿᡔᡠᡠᠼᠲᠲᡭ᠒ᡭᡆ᠐᠑ᢋᠠᢟᠡᢒᡁᢥᠧᡍᢢᡮᢦᡐᡱᠼᡝᡓᡆᠱᡮᡡᡏᢀᠽᡰᡮᡆᢜᡒᡀ᠒ᡏᢒᡜᡯᠡᡟᡀᡯᠡᡟᠩᢂᡞᡳᢋᢜᡯ᠑ᢏᠲᡑᡐ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":738,"y":1089.96,"cell":102616,"i":360,"name":"Buyanzi Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፈወፐሀደበኀየመ ፈተነጠቀጠፀሠሰደሰዘየአጰተፀዘለወወየፈፐለለበለፈዘ ደሐወኀገሠ ገኀበሀጸፈ ፐረለ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":476.9,"y":366.05,"cell":28477,"i":361,"name":"Cheongsong Monument","note":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳠⳀⳎⳊⳲⳤⳒⳈⲺⳌⳞⳊⳄ⳹ⳃ⳥ⳢⳃⳐⳌⳒ Ⳍ⳪ⳘⳠⳈ⳧Ⳅ⳾ⲴⳞⳂⳒⳀⳃⳁ⳪ⲲⳎⲸⳞⲼⳔ ⲶⲺⳜⲺⲺⳞⳌⳃⳀⳞ⳥ⲼⳚ⳧⳩ ⳠⳞⳂⳐⲼ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1239.42,"y":82.05,"cell":683,"i":362,"name":"Qinguit Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ነመአኀ ፀመከመዐጸ ነረኀፐሀከረአጸጰ ተጰ ነደሀየቀረመደሰነፀፐ ከየደዘፈአጰተጰሐ ገሐኀፀወቀፈጠደመ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1342.5,"y":605.5,"cell":67942,"i":363,"name":"Ohlstadtter Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳁ⳩⳧ⲲⲶ ⳁ Ⲿ⳾Ⳝ⳹ⲲⳒⲶⳫⳚ⳾Ⳑ⳪ⲲⳐⳈⳀⲺⳔⳁⲴ⳥ⳬⲺⳬ ⳁⲺⳚⳫⳒⳫⳆⳜⲼⳌⳔⳌⳄⳠ⳾ ⲶⳈⳢⳤ⳪ⳞⳘ⳹⳧⳥ⲲⲾⲾ⳾ⳒⲶⳚ ⳧ⳞⳄⳜⲶⳬ ⳥ⳄⳔⳢⲸⳔ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":465.35,"y":1139.94,"cell":106026,"i":364,"name":"Sumba Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳒⳂⳔⳎⳄⳚⳈⲸ ⳌⲾⳎⳢ ⳲⳃⳬⳂⳠⳚ ⳘⳖ ⳪ⳄⳔⲲⲸ⳾ⳘⲲⳜⳤ Ⳬ⳹Ⲹ ⳊⳭⳈⳲ⳩ⳔⳃⳢ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1423.73,"y":488.37,"cell":52319,"i":365,"name":"Grauernheim Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡔᠿᠽᠽ᠑ᢓᠦᡖᠪᢏᢢᡀᡒᠿᡑᢦᠨᠱᢓᢥᡏᠲᠼᠲᢂᢡᢐᢛᡐᡯᠠᠲᢡᡮᡴᢒᡭᠽᢥᠡᢟᠨᠱ᠐ᠯᡆᡍ᠑ᡁᢂᠽᢛᠭᠧᢀᡁᠭᡰᡝ᠒ᡀ᠐ᡙᢥᡟᡭᢓᢒ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":416.94,"y":995.11,"cell":96021,"i":366,"name":"Aberbeg Stele","note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༧༉༠༤༕༰༉༠༺༹༈་༦༨༚༮༆༚༱ༀ༴༦༴༯༅༫༆༚༳༤༬༥༬༡༂༲༲༭༛༃༕༨༬༕༅༙༫༡༳༴༅༉༆༻་༹༌༑༰༼༗༔༄༤༭༃༩་༵༷༷༊༅༷༱༩ༀ༘༮༁༅༄༁༛༻༇༕༐༯༠༸༛༪༓༯༖༙༯</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":504.34,"y":354.12,"cell":26422,"i":367,"name":"Jijang Megalith","note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⲳ⳥ⲺⳆⳒ ⳒⲶⳬⳎⳘ⳹ⲴⳢⳤⳭⳆⳢⳊⳃ⳩ⳒⳭⳀ⳾ⳘⳃⳘ⳧ ⲸⳫ⳾ⳘⳒ⳩ⳲⳲ ⳥ⳭⳊⳲ⳹ⲴⳫ  ⳾ⳤⲸⳫⲼ⳩ⲼⳃⳔ ⳩ⳜⳖ⳥ⳬ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":221.85,"y":598.04,"cell":67227,"i":368,"name":"Nanyang Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༷༛༃༶༼༾༭༻༬༃༰༹༕༛༐༾༛༿༺༇༂༊༨༁༖༽ༀ༒༙༁༐༣༐༙་༿ༀ༺༶༡༊༽༬༓༼༛༁༙༪༻༇༡༇༿༰༛༼༼༣༈༡༳༂༴༰༊༂༜༚</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":639.91,"y":1051,"cell":99937,"i":369,"name":"Mudgolbasim Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༬༈༹༷༩༶༂༘༼༷༡༰༹༻༙༮༺༰༓༃༪༕༲༸༢༨༩༳༧༣༫༶༑༦་༅༺༖༹༫༊༯༘་༖༛༬༪༆༱༊༲༐༱༅༡༐༦༓༥༢༶</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1593.96,"y":870.73,"cell":83673,"i":370,"name":"Kealeha Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፀሰፐጰ ሀጸመመከዘጸሀ አ በመጠ ጠየፀለረሐሀኀበሰወለሐወበቀየዐሐ ጰዐፀ ኀደለተፐነጠከገየወጸበተሐመጠነፀጠፀሰጰፀ ጰገተ  ሐአዘ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":580.08,"y":298.08,"cell":18031,"i":371,"name":"Hyang Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ለፐረ ለፈጸተጠ ተለደደጰሐፐፀዐሰደደፐበ ፈመደአቀጰደጰሐጰአየገሰፈ ለጰየጠኀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1322.95,"y":390.58,"cell":33438,"i":372,"name":"Bisch Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༵༪༳༾༃༃༉༖༘༘༐༺༵༱༩༽༕༳༆༨༥༺༲༴༬༷༸༰༬༻༵༪༘༩༘༸༌༤༠༼༵༣༪༡༶༿༲༰༘༃༙༳༌༉༤༿༲༑༦</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":218.07,"y":373.43,"cell":29948,"i":373,"name":"Kanara Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ደቀየሐበገ ደጰመሰሰጰበፈሠአነመረሠወጠደ ደከበፀሰገለሠገ ጸሐፐጰደደገጠሐሐ  ጸኀሰገመሰፈአአሰተበዘ ዘዘ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":280.22,"y":197.9,"cell":8291,"i":374,"name":"Denene Ire Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡳᠠᠾᡕᡜᡐᢂᡟᡑᢞᡖᠯᠮ᠑ᢓᡴᠿᡗᢏᢂᠦᠰᠪᡎᡠᡯᢋᡝᡠᠡᡠᢒᢂᡑᡒᠭᡳᠵᠰᢤᠡᠠᡔᠻᢦᠨᡮᡙᡆᢀ᠑ᠿᡕᢥᡙᠦᠰᠱᢜᢑᠽᡓᠯᠧᢐᡡᢤ᠐ᡭ᠑ᢟᢒᠻᡭᠩ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":432.49,"y":909.2,"cell":87707,"i":375,"name":"Sobar Effigy","note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳙ⳾ⳀⳒⳄ⳧ⳤⳲⲲ⳾ ⳐⳈⳭⳃ⳪Ⳡ ⳆⳲⳘⳆⲲⳬ Ⲿⳬ  ⳁⳚ ⳚⲲⳤⳈ⳥Ⳅ⳧ⲸⳀⲸⳁⳒⳄⳬⲶⳄⳆⳊⳜⲼⳂⳄⳲⳘⳃⲾⲶⳔⳘ⳥ⳎⳂⳘ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":207.11,"y":696.97,"cell":76008,"i":376,"name":"Chongtian Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc22𐠧 \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠤\udc21\ud802\ud802𐠂𐠲\udc2c\udc1b \udc30\udc21\udc2a\udc3c\ud802𐠊\ud802𐠍\udc28\udc0b\udc27\ud802\ud802𐠧\udc0f\udc0f\ud802𐠥𐠋𐠰\ud802\ud802𐠩𐠮\udc27\udc22\udc12𐠠\udc22\ud802 \ud802𐠂𐠔𐠎\udc1d\udc1d\udc2f\udc2a𐠌\ud802\ud802𐠗𐠬\ud802𐠪\udc14\udc1d𐠄\ud802𐠊\udc33\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":849.08,"y":497.97,"cell":53464,"i":377,"name":"Ormston Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">᠑ᡙ᠐ᢥᠲ᠐ᠵᡮᠿ᠒ᠪᢑᠰᠼᢛᡎᡲᡟᡞᡮᡓᡡᡮᠽᠩᢁᠱᠱᢀᢜᡖ᠐ᢞᡀᢜᡓᢥᡖᡟᢛᡕᠧᡰᠵ᠐ᠻᠮᢛᢏᢡᢛᡏᠽᢏᢞᡁᠵᡓᠲᡕᢞᠲᢤᡝᢑᡟᡟᡮᡴᢋᡔᠱᠮᠽᡯᡟᢞᠿᢟᢂᢒᢠᠵᡒᠨᢦ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1449.49,"y":618.12,"cell":69430,"i":378,"name":"Bodrer Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">መሰሀከጠደሀአ ጠ አተሐነፐጸ  ሐበከዐሠፀበሰነገበሰተቀጠበወኀለጠጸዐነከፀገፀ ፀፀቀ ተሰ ረመዘበ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":970.95,"y":668.48,"cell":74330,"i":379,"name":"Enis Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༲༁༄༇༤༢༂༚༫༂༕༭༁༱༣༠༩༓༣༥༄༼ༀ༃༬༧༉༴༉༭༃༑༮༷༖༨༪༴༇༂༪༕༭༄༘༌༵༮༔༔༂༭༩༷༾་༠༂༼༰༾༛༄༅༕༳༱༔༭༨༽༫༡༛༧༱༩༷༁༡༪༼༾༾༽༐༌༮༪༭༒༠༰༢༱༾༽༳༲༪</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":844.77,"y":304.97,"cell":18569,"i":380,"name":"Kenleydon Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc3c𐠮𐠩\ud802\ud802𐠤\udc31\udc2c\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \ud802\ud802𐠑\udc38\udc1c\udc0c \udc02\ud802𐠔\udc0e\ud802𐠦\udc03𐠞\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠿 \udc0f\udc31\udc13𐠕𐠈\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠿\ud802 \udc0e𐠢\udc3f𐠿\udc2b\udc16\udc10𐠗\udc10\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1404.6,"y":152.46,"cell":3964,"i":381,"name":"Ikortajik Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">አ ሠፐሐፈተወገ ፀሀ  አፈ ቀሀ ከ ሀጠፐገ ፈፈኀዐነመሰነ ሐከአከዘ ኀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1340.66,"y":377.52,"cell":30827,"i":382,"name":"Rheitinen Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡀᡆᠧᡯᢐᡕᡕᡀᡀᠨᢤᢦᡳᠳᠨᠮᢡᡁᢓᡖᡐᡝᢠᡀᡑᡗᢁᠾᡝᠨᢁᡴᠧᡀ᠀ᠠ᠐ᡠᡜᡱᠰᡞᡝᠻᠰᢋᡁ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":449.17,"y":792.48,"cell":78601,"i":383,"name":"Bygdak Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢒᡁᡯᢞᡏᠿᠵᠻᡰᠠᢡᡏᡲᡱᡯᢋᡲᡯᢛᡱᢤᠻᠳᡮᠽᢡᡭᡍᢀᠵᡙᠨᢏᠿ᠀ᡲᡍᢛᠼᡮᡑᡍᢤᠼᡞᢑᡆᡀᡁᢏᡐᠦᢑᡖᠭᢡᡱ᠀ᡰᡑᢑᡭᢛᠻᠼᡐᠪᢁᢑᡔᡍᢐᠾ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1501.88,"y":864.48,"cell":83044,"i":384,"name":"Waikipapa Runestone","note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༐༚༲༘༻༬༈༩༔༑༕༱༾༊༐༜༁༶༵༲༡༌༖༾༷༮༙༮༨༻༈༛༤༜༨༶༑༉༿༭༊༃༢༕༳༱༚༃༳༐༉༤༔༈༌༘༵༯༸༯༬༒༵༙༗༇༚༐༐༱༘༌༦༢༊༠༃༥༾༺༇༢༑༪༧༗༌</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1420.65,"y":488.22,"cell":52318,"i":385,"name":"Eschbrand Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc03𐠔𐠟\udc17 \udc01𐠸𐠸\udc27\udc1a\ud802𐠵\udc13\udc1a\udc33𐠑\udc20\udc3f𐠔\ud802\ud802𐠲\ud802 \udc15\ud802  \udc15\ud802 \udc25\udc08\udc2f\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠣\udc23\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠗\udc0d𐠒\udc17𐠋\ud802\ud802𐠄\ud802𐠔\udc3c𐠫𐠕𐠘\udc26𐠔\udc0d\udc29\ud802\ud802 𐠩𐠴𐠊\udc23𐠱</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":808.27,"y":283.25,"cell":16379,"i":386,"name":"Narararabil Statue","note":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">་༁༿༗༓༂༅༠༡༳༢༳༧༅༆༣༓༬༘༰༣༣༌༅༃༹༪༠༵༃༧༢༭༉༳༺༰༢༨༺༒༲༠༮༉༒༨༁་༸༮༑༆༌༨༖༼༼༱༉༴༰༲༻༹༯༙༽༁</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":977.22,"y":513.65,"cell":56109,"i":387,"name":"Portston Pillar","note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጸወጠለ ደፐከመደኀጰኀ ሐ ወወረዘጸመ ሠከጠተለዘሀመረሐ ለ  ዘለፈሀሐፈ አዐአበየፐዘ ቀየረነፈ  ወጠጸረዐ ዘ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1683.83,"y":431.95,"cell":42206,"i":388,"name":"Ty'athionferi Sculpture","note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳗ ⳬⳞⳐⳭ⳪ⳊⳫⳔⳚ⳾Ⲵ⳧Ⳋ⳧ⳭⳄⲲ Ⲷ⳪ⳚⲶⲴⲲ ⳀⲺ⳥ ⳪ⳀⳆⳂⳂⳘⳈ⳾⳧⳹Ⲻ⳩ ⳀⳤⳊⳖⳎⳂⳂ ⳾ ⳄⳈⳜⳲⳈⲸ⳩ⳃⳬⳃⳞⳖⳔ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1391.24,"y":522.29,"cell":57358,"i":389,"name":"Ruined Fortification","note":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1733.8,"y":423.9,"cell":40629,"i":390,"name":"Ruined Castle","note":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":876.51,"y":675.5,"cell":74877,"i":391,"name":"Ruined Town","note":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":504.98,"y":360.07,"cell":27434,"i":392,"name":"Ruined Town","note":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":846.63,"y":446.77,"cell":44470,"i":393,"name":"Ruined Temple","note":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":830.56,"y":623.17,"cell":69869,"i":394,"name":"Ruined Stronghold","note":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":340.57,"y":252.65,"cell":13176,"i":395,"name":"Ruined Town","note":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":376.8,"y":500.21,"cell":53846,"i":396,"name":"Ruined Settlement","note":"Ruins of an ancient settleme