ardians stand watch over the tombs of long-forgotten souls."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1520.16,"y":521.57,"cell":57406,"i":547,"name":"Eryndlyn Mausoleum","note":"A labyrinthine necropolis where each step echoes with haunting murmurs. The walls are adorned with ancient runes, and restless spirits guide or hinder those who dare to delve into its depths."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":293.81,"y":249.76,"cell":12913,"i":548,"name":"Bumingtokh Tomb","note":"A desolate necropolis where an eerie stillness reigns. Time seems frozen amidst the decaying mausoleums, and the silence is broken only by the whispers of the wind and the rustle of tattered banners."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1403.54,"y":296.57,"cell":17890,"i":549,"name":"Setsovi Necropolis","note":"A towering necropolis adorned with macabre sculptures and guarded by formidable undead sentinels. Its ancient halls house the remains of fallen heroes, entombed alongside their cherished relics."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1569.61,"y":236.69,"cell":11882,"i":550,"name":"Flaksvi Crypt","note":"Rising from the desolate landscape, this sinister necropolis is a testament to necromantic power. Its skeletal spires cast ominous shadows, concealing forbidden knowledge and arcane secrets."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1285.25,"y":107.52,"cell":1338,"i":551,"name":"Nujallak Cemetery","note":"A desolate necropolis where an eerie stillness reigns. Time seems frozen amidst the decaying mausoleums, and the silence is broken only by the whispers of the wind and the rustle of tattered banners."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1628.61,"y":194.64,"cell":8259,"i":552,"name":"Naram Sepulchre","note":"This ethereal necropolis seems suspended between the realms of the living and the dead. Wisps of mist dance around the tombstones, while haunting melodies linger in the air, commemorating the departed."},{"icon":"glyph-1f